Story: Flying the circuit and coming home
  As a pilot
  I want the plane to fly the waypoints in order and come home after the last one
  So that all I have to do is start it and wait

  After the takeoff, the plane flies its mission without your help. At each waypoint, the
  [[current item]] on the map moves to the next one. After the last waypoint, the mode
  changes to RTL.

  Scenario: Three waypoints, then home
    When the plane reaches a waypoint
    Then the vehicle's current item is 2
    When the plane reaches a waypoint
    Then the vehicle's current item is 3
    When the plane reaches the last item
    Then the plane is flying home
    And the autopilot mode is RTL

Story: Flying the circuit again
  As a pilot
  I want to start the mission over without landing
  So that I can fly another lap

  WP1 sends the plane back to the first item of its mission. When the mission starts with a
  takeoff, that is the takeoff: a plane that is flying takes off again, or has done it already
  and goes on to the first waypoint, and either way it flies the circuit again. It does not land.

  Scenario: Back to the first waypoint
    When the plane reaches a waypoint
    Then the vehicle's current item is 2
    When the plane reaches a waypoint
    Then the vehicle's current item is 3
    When the operator restarts the mission
    Then the vehicle's current item is at most 2
